                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">How buyers describe it</th>
                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Watch for</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Sucralose (often with ace-K)</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Closest to sugar, strong and dessert-like</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Can taste too sweet; artificial</td>
                  </tr>
