          <p>
            The practical rule: if you have hated a stevia-sweetened product before, look for sucralose or monk fruit, and if you dislike strong sweetness, look for a lightly sweetened or unflavored powder and add your own flavor. Our <a href="/best-unflavored-protein-powder/">best unflavored protein powder</a> guide covers the plain options for people who would rather sweeten to taste.
          </p>
