                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Watery</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Use milk instead of water, or add ice and blend</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Clumpy</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Liquid first, then powder; use a whisk ball or blender</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Earthy or bitter</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Blend with banana, cocoa, coffee or nut butter</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Chalky aftertaste</td>
