          <p>
            Finally, do not judge a powder on the first scoop at room temperature with water. Buyers who report changing their mind about a flavor almost always changed how they made it. Give a tub three or four tries with different liquids before you write it off, and if it still does not work as a shake, use it in oats, yogurt or baking, where flavor matters less.
          </p>
