          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best tasting protein powder is the one you finish. Buyer consensus points to Dymatize ISO100 as the most consistently well-rated range, Optimum Nutrition Gold Standard Double Rich Chocolate as the safest chocolate, Ghost Whey for dessert flavors, Transparent Labs for stevia-sweetened isolate, and Orgain for plant protein that does not taste like a field. None of that replaces your own taste buds, which is why buying small first is the most useful advice on this page.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
